\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1\cf0 . Stay, my soul, by Jesus always!
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Be of care, watch Him each day!
\par For within the carnal life here
\par Surely sin will follow thee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  Hold steadfast to what you have now,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Never should you lose control,
\par Keep on moving toward heaven,
\par Never turn back on your goal.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3. Maintain honesty unto death,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj Consciously discriminate,
\par Provide strength for Thy weakened hands
\par And for Thy knuckles as well.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  All that lead to discouragement
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0  And your baggage full of sin
\par  Cast all these behind you for once
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 And keep running in your fight!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  5.  Keep control on fleshly desires
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 And the temptations they pose,
\par Hold your fight against sin in check
\par Even at the cost of blood!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  6.  Persevere in tribulation
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 As a good Christian fighter,
\par Be thou honest as His merchant,
\par Work always in His vineyard!
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  7.  When your Lord does surely come back,
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 You will never be disgraced,
\par What He will give you in Heaven
\par \pard      Will be a just recompense.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

